 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwTqKhhqiCZrI2D4yzW1MuMGV5KBTdc2Lh_bw-8jEeInR2CyvDKTbg13RUfNy31s-N5lMeEPgKNPB4s3xPe0Ki9bAc8yEQHahBLX9w7A4TW45S2gK7DOCpwkKSACmBlaGpmh5T2p2byFCPPOsn885Hq6JvzBjNrI3DwjxZLLeTUZRtd_zB4Xr1jL_gp6M/s1440/3_61fbf095-6b03-4aa4-9c8d-971c26e5fab5.webp\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgwTqKhhqiCZrI2D4yzW1MuMGV5KBTdc2Lh_bw-8jEeInR2CyvDKTbg13RUfNy31s-N5lMeEPgKNPB4s3xPe0Ki9bAc8yEQHahBLX9w7A4TW45S2gK7DOCpwkKSACmBlaGpmh5T2p2byFCPPOsn885Hq6JvzBjNrI3DwjxZLLeTUZRtd_zB4Xr1jL_gp6M/s1440/3_61fbf095-6b03-4aa4-9c8d-971c26e5fab5.webp\" /></a></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Zu Elements es una marca italiana de moda urbana y casual centrada principalmente en ropa masculina, con un fuerte enfoque en denim y estilo streetwear.</div>\n\n<div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: none; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">Cargando productos, por favor espera...</div>\n\n<div id=\"web-oficial-container\" style=\"display: none; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px 0px 40px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.zuelements.it/?utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&utm_medium=boton_oficial&utm_campaign=catalogo_zuelements\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border-radius: 6px; color: white; display: inline-block; font-family: Helvetica Neue, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 14px 36px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;\" target=\"_blank\">Ir a la web oficial</a>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;font-family:Arial;}\n.producto-card{border:1px solid #eaeaea;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;background:#fff;}\n.producto-card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}\n.producto-title{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:600;}\n.producto-link{display:block;background:#111;color:#fff;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;}\n</style>\n\n<script>\nvar SITEMAP_URL = \"https://www.zuelements.it/sitemap_products_1.xml?from=8373399552213&to=15971270164860\";\nvar APPS_SCRIPT = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxo5Q4FNyOpLE4qEDHgZVzdavmxZQMUhQmCak2RjWRNJqQI0uqxcqjgHp2y81mxznFg/exec\";\nvar APPS_SCRIPT_CLICS = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbymjaZZpelLTpLoZ5t19Y_ppTRW0JH_qbOLxhUHANIH4Yk_OWzCkoXefdSRcQw3qRyu0Q/exec\";\nvar paginaActual = 1;\nvar cargando = false;\nvar hayMas = true;\nvar cola = false;\n\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  var conector = p.url.includes(\"?\") ? \"&\" : \"?\";\n  var utm = conector + \"utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&utm_medium=tarjeta_producto&utm_campaign=catalogo_zuelements\";\n  var urlConUtm = p.url + utm;\n  var urlClic = APPS_SCRIPT_CLICS + \"?producto=\" + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo) + \"&url=\" + encodeURIComponent(p.url);\n  return \"<div class=\\\"producto-card\\\">\" +\n    (p.imagen ? \"<img src=\\\"\" + p.imagen + \"\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" alt=\\\"\" + p.titulo + \"\\\" onerror=\\\"this.style.display='none'\\\">\" : \"\") +\n    \"<div class=\\\"producto-title\\\">\" + p.titulo + \"</div>\" +\n    \"<a class=\\\"producto-link\\\" href=\\\"\" + urlConUtm + \"\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" onclick=\\\"fetch('\" + urlClic + \"',{mode:'no-cors'})\\\">Comprar ahora</a>\" +\n    \"</div>\";\n}\n\nasync function cargarProductos(){\n  if(cargando || !hayMas) return;\n  cargando = true;\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"block\";\n  try {\n    var res = await fetch(APPS_SCRIPT + \"?sitemap=\" + encodeURIComponent(SITEMAP_URL) + \"&pagina=\" + paginaActual);\n    var data = await res.json();\n    document.getElementById(\"tienda-catalogo\").innerHTML += data.productos.map(crearTarjeta).join(\"\");\n    hayMas = data.hayMas;\n    paginaActual++;\n    if(!hayMas) document.getElementById(\"web-oficial-container\").style.display = \"block\";\n  } catch(e){ console.log(e); }\n  document.getElementById(\"loader\").style.display = \"none\";\n  cargando = false;\n  if(cola){ cola = false; cargarProductos(); }\n}\n\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function(){\n  cargarProductos();\n  var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n    if(entries[0].isIntersecting){ if(cargando){ cola=true; return; } cargarProductos(); }\n  }, {rootMargin:\"250px\"});\n  observer.observe(document.getElementById(\"sentinel\"));\n});\n</script>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n<a href=\"https://www.zuelements.it/?utm_source=ropaycomplementosaliazon&utm_medium=enlace_texto_inferior&utm_campaign=catalogo_zuelements\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><b>IR A LA WEB OFICIAL</b></a>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">SI ESTÁ AGOTADA TU TALLA, COLOR O NO ENVÍAN A TU DESTINO CONTÁCTANOS: <a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></span></div>",
